cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the paper below.  If you use the
  channel impulse responses or the noise statistics, please also cite the
  Zenodo dataset listed under references.
type: software
title: "Underwater Acoustic Channel Toolbox (MATLAB)"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB toolbox for replaying signals through measured underwater acoustic channels, generating realistic ocean noise, and unpacking stored impulse responses.
